================================

Database: PostgreSQL
Required version: PostgreSQL 14+

Migration format:
    SQL UP / DOWN files

FOLDER STRUCTURE
----------------

database/
    migrations/
        env.cs
        README
        script.cs.mako
        versions/

VERSIONS
--------

